  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Roughly chop parsley.\n• Roughly chop capsicum into bite-sized chunks.\n• Drain and rinse cannellini beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667206a484cee959c7f21268-13cf0d30.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook soffritto mix and capsicum, stirring, until softened, 6-7 minutes.\n• Add half the garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667206a484cee959c7f21268-31ca4a1e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add cannellini beans, All-American spice blend and tomato paste to the pan. Cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add passata, the salt, BBQ sauce and the water. Cook, stirring, until well combined, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add baby spinach leaves, stirring until wilted. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667206a484cee959c7f21268-874cdfca.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer bean mixture to a baking dish.\n• Sprinkle evenly with Cheddar cheese.\n• Bake until thickened and cheese is melted, 10-12 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667206a484cee959c7f21268-46340fbb.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice bake-at-home ciabatta in half, lengthways.\n• Place the butter and remaining garlic in a small microwave-safe bowl. Microwave in 10 second bursts until melted.\n• Stir through half the parsley. Season with salt and pepper.\n• Brush garlic butter over the cut-side of ciabatta slices.\n• Place ciabatta slices directly on a wire rack in the oven. Bake until golden, 5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667206a484cee959c7f21268-2e249f1b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide BBQ baked cannellini beans between bowls.\n• Garnish with remaining parsley. Sprinkle with pickled jalapeños (if using).\n• Serve with herby garlic bread. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667206a484cee959c7f21268-fc17beb6.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
